# Only preferences/ is worth tracking. Everything else here is either owned by
# someone else or regenerated by Alfred.

# Workflows belong to their own upstreams, not here: third-party ones
# auto-update in place, and the self-made one is versioned in nobv/den.
#   com.alfredapp.vitor.1password   github.com/alfredapp/1password-workflow
#   jp.van-guard.den.desk-switcher  nobv/den, alfred/
Alfred.alfredpreferences/workflows/

# Alfred Remote pages. Deleting them in the GUI does not stick: Alfred re-seeds
# its stock pages (~1.5M of icons) whenever it initialises a preferences
# folder. Unignore this if the Remote app ever gets real use.
Alfred.alfredpreferences/remote/
